			"notes": "This release:\n- Fixes [Issue #55](https://github.com/KadTheHunter/AccurateBlockPlacement-Reborn/issues/55) \"Erroneous block placement at low FPS due to changes in Minecraft 26.1\"\n- Improves the fix for [Issue #28](https://github.com/KadTheHunter/AccurateBlockPlacement-Reborn/issues/28) \"Shulker Boxes do not immediately open when placing and holding right-click\"\n  - _A previous fix to prevent accidentally opening containers whilst placing blocks was poorly implemented. Going forward it should be much harder to do so._\n- Cleans up various parts of the code\n- Updates Russian translations (thanks [@chtko](https://github.com/chtko) and [@AnarchByte](https://crowdin.com/profile/anarchbyte)!)\n- Completes Portuguese (Brazilian) translations (thanks [@murilommelo](https://github.com/murilommelo)!)"
