			"notes": "This release:\n\n- Fixes the vanilla behavior of scaffolding being inaccessible when Accurate Block Placement is enabled (#19)\n- Fixes Shulker Boxes vanilla behavior when right-click is held being inaccessible when Accurate Block Placement is enabled (#28)\n  - This may be tweaked in future updates, as this fix has introduced an inconsistently replicated issue with unwanted opening of shulker boxes and other storage blocks when mass placing them.\n- Adds two new options in the config \"Confirmation\" and \"Confirmation Type\"\n  - \"Confirmation\" toggles whether a confirmation message will be sent when a feature is toggled on or off\n  - \"Confirmation Type\" determines where the confirmation is sent (Chat or HUD)\n- Improved the wording and colorization of the confirmation message\n- Credited LordEnder-Kitty to the contributor list for their suggestion of and work on the confirmation options (#27)\n\nThe mod has been compiled for both 1.21-1.21.1, and 1.21.2-1.21.4. Please make sure you download the correct copy for your version of Minecraft."
